f the four analyzed inputs; only the logical service split (SVC-001..004) and the POM pattern are documented (source: `architecture/ARCH-SPEC.md` line 3-23; `adrs/ADR-SPEC.md` line 13-19).\n   304|\n   305|### Where to Look for X\n   306|status: pending - no evidence in inputs\n   307|- Cannot be populated: no file/directory paths exist in any of the four analyzed inputs (source: `architecture/ARCH-SPEC.md` open_questions, line 134-135).\n   308|\n   309|## For ux-design.md\n   310|### User Journeys\n   311|status: complete\n   312|- Homepage Navigation Validation journey: homepage loads correctly, all primary navigation elements functional (source: `prd.md` FR-001, line 11-18; `epics.md` EPIC-002, line 26-38).\n   313|- \"What FIFA Does\" Subpages Navigation journey: navigate to Legal, Transfer system, Women's Football, Advancing football, Refereeing, Innovation, Talent development from `/all-topics` (source: `prd.md` FR-002, line 20-30; `epics.md` EPIC-003, line 42-54).\n   314|- Top Navigation \"Inside FIFA\" Validation journey: \"Inside FIFA\" button and all sub-items accessible and navigable (source: `prd.md` FR-003, line 32-39; `epics.md` EPIC-004, line 58-70).\n   315|\n   316|### Components and Interactions\n   317|status: complete\n   318|- Top navigation \"Inside FIFA\" menu: button accessible, sub-items discovered/testable, dropdown/click functionality, sub-item navigation (source: `epics.md` EPIC-004, line 67-70).\n   319|- Language switching mechanism/interaction: switch between English (fully tested), Spanish and French (testable), with language-specific selectors managed (source: `prd.md` FR-004, line 41-47; `epics.md` EPIC-005, line 74-86).\n   320|\n   321|### States and Viewports\n   322|status: complete\n   323|- Responsive breakpoint states: mobile (375px), tablet (768px), large desktop (1440px), each with responsive element validation (source: `epics.md` EPIC-007, line 107-119).\n   324|- Initial supported desktop viewport: 1920x1080 (source: `p