artifacts/inputs/tech-blueprints/l4-concerns/security-baseline.md` | written |\n| Staged blueprint: pre-ship-checklist | `artifacts/inputs/tech-blueprints/l4-concerns/pre-ship-checklist.md` | written |\n| Extraction: prd.md | `artifacts/outputs/context-pack-analysis/_extractions/prd.md` | written |\n| Extraction: epics.md | `artifacts/outputs/context-pack-analysis/_extractions/epics.md` | written |\n| Extraction: ADR-SPEC.md | `artifacts/outputs/context-pack-analysis/_extractions/ADR-SPEC.md` | written |\n| Extraction: ARCH-SPEC.md | `artifacts/outputs/context-pack-analysis/_extractions/ARCH-SPEC.md` | written |\n== progress.md ==\n---\ndocument_type: progress-ledger\nproject: stepwise-fifa-qa\ncreated_at: 2026-08-21T20:10:00Z\n---\n# Progress Ledger: stepwise-fifa-qa\n\n| Session | Date | Capability | Skill | Status | Artifacts | Notes |\n|---------|------|------------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\n| BLUEPRINT-STEPWISE-FIFA-QA-20260821 | 2026-08-21 | build-context-pack | tech-blueprints | COMPLETED | 3 blueprints staged (node-typescript, security-baseline, pre-ship-checklist) | No L1/L3 selected — test-automation project with no hosting surface and no agentic component |\n| ANALYZE-STEPWISE-FIFA-QA-20260821 | 2026-08-21 | build-context-pack | analyze-context-pack-inputs | COMPLETED | 17 analysis-sections | Scope restricted to 4 caller-selected inputs (adrs, architecture, epics.md, prd.md); 4 source extractions produced via parallel fan-out |\n== generation progress folder ==\n[exit code: 1]","isError":false}}
